# No Native Date Inputs

Never use the native HTML date input in Nexora ERP UI.

## Forbidden

```tsx
<input type="date" />
<input type={field.type === "date" ? "date" : "text"} />
```

## Required

Use the shared enterprise date components from `@/shared/ui`:

- `DatePicker` — single date in forms and filters
- `DatePickerField` — labeled form field with validation styling
- `DateRangePickerField` — range selection in one control
- `DateFilterInput` / `DateRangeFilterInput` — list/report filter bars

Form values must remain ISO `YYYY-MM-DD` for server compatibility. Display formatting comes from locale and company date format via `EnterpriseUiProvider`.
